# ── Embedded puzzle data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fetched via `make data`, never committed. A bare `go build` compiles with an
# empty embed and fetches the feed at runtime instead. The feed/ dir itself
# stays tracked (via .gitkeep) so the directory embed always resolves.
/internal/data/feed/puzzle.json

